From: omp <omp@valor.digital>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:24:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] hermes-plugin: provider off in gateway sessions for
 platform users the token does not speak for

Hermes passes user_id to initialize() only in gateway sessions (Telegram, Discord, Slack, ...). One vbm_ token is one person's memory: every person talking to the bot recalled and wrote as the token's owner. The provider now stays off there unless VALORBRAIN_GATEWAY_USERS lists the platform user (or is *). CLI sessions are unchanged.
